<div class="col-md-6 col-sm-12" data-zesty-id="design:columns:2columns:7:77-1:2 Columns - Equal:1">
<h5 data-zesty-id="content:text:5:35">Adopt a Meal for a month</h5>
<p data-zesty-id="content:textarea:6:54">
					Supporters can adopt a month's worth of meals for a woman or child, staying at The Salvation Army Center of Hope Shelter. A <strong>$50</strong> commitment takes care of the individual food cost.
				</p>
